    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait pls dont scare me like that, i dont want to go to the er if it's not necessary, it's so expensive and she's normally so energetic. she's probably just exhausted because her body is fighting the fever, right? like she's just really sleepy because she's worn out. i really just want to get her fever under control at home so she can rest. can u please just tell me the ml amount for 42lbs from the 160mg/5ml bottle? i just need to know the right number so i dont mess it up.",
